          {
            "title": "Question #1",
            "id": 120354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist eine Sache, die wir immer tun wollen, wenn eine HTTP-Anfrage fehlschlägt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sende eine Fehlermeldung an den Benutzer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setze den Statuscode auf <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sende die Anfrage an einen anderen Server</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sende eine Fehlermeldung an den Benutzer.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist eine Sache, die wir immer tun wollen, wenn eine HTTP-Anfrage fehlschlägt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sende eine Fehlermeldung an den Benutzer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setze den Statuscode auf <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sende die Anfrage an einen anderen Server</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Die Anfrage wiederholen, ohne dem Benutzer zu antworten</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sende eine Fehlermeldung an den Benutzer.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #2",
            "id": 120359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die <code>GET</code>-Anfrage, um die vom Client gesendeten Informationen zu speichern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>req.params</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #4",
            "id": 120357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Code verwenden wir in dieser <code>GET</code>-Anfrage, um den HTTP-Statuscode festzulegen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.status</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.json</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>res.status</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Zweig für ein fehlendes Mitglied verkettet <code>res.status(...).json(...)</code>. Was bewirkt diese Kette?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sie setzt den Fehlerstatus und sendet dann den JSON-Fehler-Body</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sie sendet zuerst JSON und ändert dann nach Ende der Antwort den Status</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sie ändert den Routenparameter, bevor sie die Abfrage wiederholt</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sie wandelt die fehlende Zeile in eine erfolgreiche Antwort um</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sie setzt den Fehlerstatus und sendet dann den JSON-Fehler-Body.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #4",
            "id": 120361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den Code, um einen <code>404</code> Fehlercode im Response-Objekt festzulegen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"222\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>.status(404)</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL Database Connection",
            "id": 120848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie bereiten wir eine SQL-Anweisung vor, die in der Variable <code>sql</code> gespeichert ist, wenn unsere Datenbankverbindung in der Variable <code>db</code> gespeichert ist?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.execute(sql)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.query(sql)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>db.prepare(sql)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du setzt <code>sql = \"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code> und schreibst dann <code>db.prepare(\"sql\")</code>.</p><p>Welcher Ersatz bereitet die gespeicherte Abfrage vor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM sql\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sql.prepare(db)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(db)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>db.prepare(sql)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Response",
            "id": 120935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Informationen sollte ein <code>POST</code>-Endpunkt in seiner Antwort enthalten?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ein Statuscode und eine Bestätigung, dass die Daten hinzugefügt wurden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Statuscode und nur der neue Dateneintrag</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nur ein Statuscode</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ein Statuscode und eine Bestätigung, dass die Daten hinzugefügt wurden.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du hast erfolgreich einen Flug hinzugefügt. Welche Antwort setzt den passenden Status und bestätigt das Hinzufügen ausdrücklich?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Status <code>201</code> und <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>404</code> und <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>201</code> und nur die neuen Flugdaten</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>201</code> und <code>\"Flight deleted successfully\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Status <code>201</code> und <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Endpoint Path",
            "id": 120849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle den richtigen Endpunkt aus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:number&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"/flights\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den Collection-Endpoint, der jeden Flug zurückgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>get</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"/flights\"</code>, <code>\"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code> und schließlich <code>.all()</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #2",
            "id": 120355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht der Express-Code, wenn ein Benutzer ein Mitglied anfordert, das nicht existiert?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sendet dem Client eine Fehlermeldung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Fehler tritt auf und der Client erhält keine Informationen</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der Server fordert zusätzliche Informationen an</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sendet dem Client eine Fehlermeldung.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Datenbankabfrage kann kein Mitglied zurückgeben. Warum prüft der Handler das Ergebnis, bevor er Erfolgs-JSON sendet?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um statt einer falschen Erfolgsantwort den Fehler für das fehlende Mitglied zurückzugeben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um dieselbe Abfrage zu wiederholen, bis ein Mitglied erscheint</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um die angeforderte ID durch die ID des ersten Mitglieds zu ersetzen</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Um automatisch ein neues Mitglied einzufügen, wenn keines existiert</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um statt einer falschen Erfolgsantwort den Fehler für das fehlende Mitglied zurückzugeben.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL & PUT & DELETE",
            "id": 120994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Art von SQL-Anweisung ist mit einem PUT-Endpunkt verbunden?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">AKTUALISIEREN</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">LÖSCHEN</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">DROP</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle AKTUALISIEREN aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Handler für <code>PUT /flights/:id</code> ersetzt die gespeicherten Felder des angegebenen Flugs. Welche SQL-Form entspricht diesem Vorgang?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP TABLE flights</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO flights ...</code> ohne ID-Bedingung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: DELETE II",
            "id": 120998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die <code>response</code>-Syntax für den <code>DELETE</code>-Endpunkt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { id } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = db.prepare(sql).run(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (result.changes &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight deleted successfully&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"197\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"201\" /><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"207\" /><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option startIndex=\"208\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>res</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>200</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
